{"channelId":"UCHCYSmPfHsDGv8OCdxsJHyw","row":["Veterinary Science",396,"Chantilly Veterinary Science at Chantilly Academy:\nThis two-year program enables students to study animals and gain experience in the care of a variety of animals. The course is designed for students interested in animal health sciences careers. Topics include animal anatomy, animal behavior, handling techniques, nutrition, disease pathology, sanitation, and disease control. Students learn to handle and restrain dogs and cats while performing pet grooming services. Instruction is enhanced through field trips, professional guest speakers, and demonstrations. In addition, students can develop leadership skills in the co-curricular FFA.","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCHCYSmPfHsDGv8OCdxsJHyw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCHCYSmPfHsDGv8OCdxsJHyw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:10:35.993Z","channelId":"UCHCYSmPfHsDGv8OCdxsJHyw","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"10d78d1b57748c33e4e641a9fe8e2d31e7fb1806b0ffba00ebfdcb5b692e6df2","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"71f2212066557f7cf8e6b04ee26d0bd936b7bd5e08ffc683b28af2da93da1b28"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCHCYSmPfHsDGv8OCdxsJHyw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:10:35.993Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCHCYSmPfHsDGv8OCdxsJHyw","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":396,"raw":"396 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCHCYSmPfHsDGv8OCdxsJHyw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:10:35.993Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"veterinarian","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"unconfirmed","role":"undetermined","flags":["当前仅有相关内容或名称线索，尚无匹配的本人专业简介；不列入职业联系优选"],"sourceUrls":[]}],"cleanup":{"status":"review","code":"biography_audience_review","reason":"简介上下文未证明本人与目标人群的关